         "t": "text",
         "html": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #12aa9b;\">ABOUT </span>CLEARFIELD PARK</h3>"
        },
        {
         "t": "text",
         "html": "<p>Residents here enjoy short walks to downtown San Carlos, as well as easy access to the Airport, Caltrain, and Highway 101. The neighborhood is filled with attractive modern homes and has a friendly sense of community.</p>",
